{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-36","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"sowohl … als auch · Gesundheit 4","bn":"দুটোই · স্বাস্থ্য ৪"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lerne sowohl Deutsch ___ Englisch.","options":["oder","noch","als auch"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-36-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„sowohl … als auch“ মানে কী?","options":["দুটোই","দুটোর কোনোটিই না","দুটোর একটি"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-36-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Sowohl mein Vater als auch meine Mutter arbeiten.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমার বাবা-মা কেউ কাজ করেন না।","আমার বাবা আর মা দুজনেই কাজ করেন।","আমার বাবা বা মা কাজ করেন।"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-36-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sowohl der Hausarzt als auch der Facharzt ___ mir geholfen.","options":["hat","ist","haben"],"answer":2,"explanation":"দুজন কর্তা → বহুবচন haben।","id":"b1-practice-36-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„untersuchen“ মানে কী?","options":["পরীক্ষা করা","গেলা","চুলকানো"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-36-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Arzt ___ mir eine Tablette. (প্রেসক্রাইব করা)","options":["impft","verschreibt","schluckt"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-36-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„impfen“ মানে কী?","options":["এক্স-রে করা","পরিমাপ করা","টিকা দেওয়া"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-36-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Krankenschwester will das Fieber ___. (পরিমাপ করা)","options":["messen","misst","gemessen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"will + infinitive।","id":"b1-practice-36-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„einschlafen“ মানে কী?","options":["অশ্রু ঝরা","ঘুমিয়ে পড়া","ফিরে আসা"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-36-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Meine Haut ___. (চুলকানো)","options":["spritzt","juckt","drückt"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-36-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ ist die Arbeit interessant, andererseits ist sie anstrengend. (একদিকে)","options":["Sowohl","Entweder","Einerseits"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-36-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Nebenwirkung“ মানে কী?","options":["পার্